


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_b6b22d60:


    "正在举行火锅派对的宿管室。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_e775581e:



    voice "2SA_1021"
    sachiko "「圣夜夜？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_ab8ee796:



    voice "2MI_1144"
    miyako "「哇？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_3e932560:


    "祥子豪爽地搭着圣夜子的肩膀。她好像有点上头。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_23e6e63e:



    voice "2SA_1022"
    sachiko "「你从刚才起就很安静啊……呃，你一直在吃螃蟹吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_e9574ffd:



    voice "2MI_1145"
    miyako "「是的，停不下来……唔？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_42f14e31:


    "圣夜子闻到了。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_e405552c:



    voice "2SA_1023"
    sachiko "「怎么了？有酒味？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_3d4e6d8a:



    voice "2MI_1146"
    miyako "「还有混杂其中的烟味」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_8ad91372:



    voice "2SA_1024"
    sachiko "「鼻子真灵啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_025dcb71:



    voice "2MI_1147"
    miyako "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_2acaafaa:


    "圣夜子似乎想到了什么。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_8aa3b0ef:


    "她想到的大概是……"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_673a026b:



    voice "2SA_1025"
    sachiko "「什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_6e46ad0d:



    voice "2MI_1148"
    miyako "「寻找自我，挺不错的」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_0847fa02:



    voice "2SA_1026"
    sachiko "「哈？你突然说什么呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_e45ca33c:



    voice "2MI_1149"
    miyako "「在去过各种地方、体验过各种事情后，觉得你果然很厉害」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_c3df46a1:



    voice "2SA_1027"
    sachiko "「是吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_c088a693:



    voice "2MI_1150"
    miyako "「会画画，会料理，而且手很巧。我还把握不准感官的感觉，事事都做不好」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_15eadd71:



    voice "2SA_1028"
    sachiko "「这只是习惯与不习惯的区别啦。我和你的差距源于实际体验的差距。做天使的百万年不如做人的一年。你也……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_7a5dc908:



    voice "2MI_1151"
    miyako "「我也想试试寻找自我」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_fbd72122:



    voice "2SA_1029"
    sachiko "「没那个必要。你现在这样不出远门，不也每天都找到了吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_eaf2e26f:



    voice "2SA_1030"
    sachiko "「我眼中的你，比你眼中的我还要闪闪发光」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_ee098e54:


    "祥子起身拍了拍圣夜子的头。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_93fc9b74:



    voice "2MI_1152"
    miyako "「你去哪？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_b7ef4dda:



    voice "2SA_1031"
    sachiko "「去准备杂烩粥」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_cde5e549:


    "祥子一边说着，一边走向洗碗池。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_07_ea4367e6:



    voice "2SA_1032"
    sachiko "「我是因为一无所有，才必须出门寻找啊」"
